Mini File Manager Custom Open Source License v1.0

Copyright (c) 2026 常见

You can:
1. Use it for free, do whatever
2. Modify the source code
3. Sell it for money
4. Distribute the original or modified version

But:

1. Attribution
When you distribute it, keep the original author's name
in README / LICENSE / About page / Splash screen.

2. Don't claim it as yours
Don't say you wrote it from scratch,
say it's based on Mini File Manager.

3. No warranty
Code is provided as-is, if it breaks, don't blame me.

4. Do not do illegal stuff
Don't use it for illegal purposes, you take the consequences.

5. Scope of Application
This license is permanent and automatically applies to all past, present, and future code versions in this repository.
Regardless of whether the author continues to update, anyone may still commercialize, modify, and distribute any existing version under this license.

6. Contact
ygrudh@proton.me

If you don't follow the rules above, the license is void.

第三方组件说明

本项目使用了以下第三方开源组件，这些组件各自遵循其原始协议：

